# Complete Multi-Agent Clinical Decision Support System

##  Core System Implementation
- Symptom Agent: Keyword-based symptom extraction with confidence scoring
-  Hypothesis Agent: BioGPT-powered diagnostic hypothesis generation with RAG
-  Validator Agent: Medical ontology validation and clinical rule checking
-  XAI Agent: SHAP/LIME explanations and counterfactual analysis
-  Confidence Agent: Bayesian uncertainty quantification and reliability scoring
-  Clinical Workflow: LangGraph orchestration with state management
-  Streamlit App: Complete UI with real-time analysis and export capabilities

## Bug Fixes & Optimizations
-  Fixed SymptomAgent NER model loading timeout issues
-  Fixed ClinicalWorkflow syntax errors and missing methods
-  Added WorkflowState dataclass for proper state management
-  Implemented async/sync workflow execution
-  Added comprehensive error handling and agent fallback

